      "machineText": "Wails v3中*沒有*套件層級的對話方塊建構函式；每個對話方塊都透過`app.Dialog`管理器建立。在服務中，請透過`application.Get()`取得應用程式（它會傳回執行中的`*application.App`）：",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In Wails v3 there are *no* package-level dialog constructors — every dialog is created through the `…",
