      "machineText": "對應的方法為用於訊息對話方塊的`app.Dialog.Info() / Question() / Warning() / Error()`，以及用於檔案對話方塊的`app.Dialog.OpenFile() / SaveFile()`（另有`*WithOptions`變體）。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The matching methods are `app.Dialog.Info() / Question() / Warning() / Error()` for message dialogs …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
